    {
      "title_cn": "Cloudflare：打补丁前先守住 NetScaler 入口",
      "title_en": "Cloudflare: Defend the NetScaler front door before patching",
      "title_original": "There's always a patient zero: Defending the NetScaler front door before the patch",
      "source": "Cloudflare Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-10-19T13:00:00+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/protect-your-netscaler-gateway/",
      "category": "internet",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "Cloudflare 介绍了 Citrix NetScaler 的一个重大漏洞，其中被主动利用的缺陷可让攻击者无需登录即在受影响网关上执行命令，并敦促客户立即打补丁。",
      "what_happened_en": "Cloudflare described a major Citrix NetScaler vulnerability whose actively exploited flaw let attackers run commands on affected gateways without signing in, and urged customers to patch immediately.",
      "why_it_matters": "该问题不限于 NetScaler：任何可在互联网访问的内部应用，如远程桌面门户和管理控制台，都应同样审视是否真的需要无限制的互联网可达性。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The issue extends beyond NetScaler: any internal application reachable on the Internet, such as remote desktop portals and admin consoles, deserves the same scrutiny of whether unrestricted Internet access is needed.",
      "importance_score": 72,
      "supply_level": 1,
      "section": "explore",
      "ranking_score": 73.2,
      "content_type": "news",
