      "title_cn": "欧几里得望远镜发现新彗星",
      "title_en": "Euclid discovers new comet",
      "title_original": "Euclid discovers new comet",
      "source": "ESA",
      "published_at": "2026-10-19T12:00:00+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Euclid/Euclid_discovers_new_comet",
      "category": "space",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "ESA's Euclid space telescope discovered its first previously unknown comet, C/2026 S1 (Euclid), in images taken between 16 and 24 September 2026, using moving object detection software developed by Mikko Pöntinen of the University of Helsinki with the Euclid Consortium's Solar System Objects Science Working Group.",
      "what_happened_en": "ESA's Euclid space telescope discovered its first previously unknown comet, C/2026 S1 (Euclid), in images taken between 16 and 24 September 2026, using moving object detection software developed by Mikko Pöntinen of the University of Helsinki with the Euclid Consortium's Solar System Objects Science Working Group.",
      "why_it_matters": "快速的识别与验证表明，欧几里得能在彗星距太阳仍较远时发现新彗星，可能为欧空局未来的彗星拦截器任务提供目标。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The quick identification and validation shows Euclid can detect new comets while still relatively far from the Sun, potentially yielding a target for ESA's future Comet Interceptor mission.",
      "importance_score": 70,
      "supply_level": 1,
